OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells with a
OL,6,Ffew showers around in the morning,
OL,7,Fbecoming largely dry through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Fresh westerly winds for
OL,9,FShetland at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FStaying dry through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight for Shetland
OL,13,Fwith some clear spells. Mostly dry for
OL,14,FOrkney with some clear spells but also
OL,15,Fthe odd light shower possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
