OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloud and rain soon spread
OL,6,Fnortheast through the morning, rain
OL,7,Fheavy at times. Some bright spells and
OL,8,Fshowers developing in the afternoon
OL,9,Falong with strengthening southwesterly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBright
OL,13,Fspells and scattered showers over the
OL,14,Ffollowing few days, showers heavy at
OL,15,Ftimes. Strong winds ease through
OL,16,FWednesday, breezy again Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
